        "content": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    S = 85\n    K = 90\n    r = 0.05\n    c = 10\n    p = 15\n    T = 5\n\n    # Put-call parity: c - p = S*exp(-q*T) - K*exp(-r*T)\n    discounted_stock = c - p + K * math.exp(-r * T)\n    q = -math.log(discounted_stock / S) / T\n    answer = round(q * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
